The skill and its scheduler are gone; the pass is Common Lisp in this folder.
Rewritten: the corroboration gate (a fact is proposed only once it was said
on separate days), the six-signal score with the 0.55 gate, the proposal
dossier the model acts on (verbatim text, why, nearest memory), the
near-duplicate and still-relevant sections, memory pressure against a
character budget, the reject list, the diary, the once-a-night worker and the
nightly prompt's rules. Left out, and why: the fact store and the
conversation transcripts the original mines for mentions (a Nodecode sighting
is that mention, recorded by the model as the person speaks, so no second
store is needed); the message screen for secrets and injected instructions
(the organism's own memory path carries it, and nothing here republishes a
message); the optional cloud judge, which the original ships off; and the
three scheduled extraction and forget jobs, which have nothing to extract
here.
